# 添字の中の丸括弧（書き先・読み・ガードの辺）と、一点の定数の塊
field a : max bound 16
a[(i + 1) % 5] <- i   for (i) in 0 .. 9
field b : max bound 16 4
b[i, (j * 2) % 3] <- (i + j) * (2)   for (i) in 0 .. 5 for (j) in 0 .. 3 if (a[i % 5] - 1) >= (1)
field c : max bound 16
c[(2) + 3] <- 7
c[i] <- a[(i + 2) % 5] + (b[i, (i) % 3])   for (i) in 0 .. 5
print a
print b
print c
